@file FormalConjectures/Arxiv/1308.0994/BoxdotConjecture.lean
@decl Arxiv.«1308.0994».KTProof
-- L4DEL: title: `KTProof Γ φ` denotes that `φ` is provable from the premises `Γ` in the normal modal logic KT (also called T)
-- L4DEL: intuition: `KTProof Γ φ` denotes that `φ` is provable from the premises `Γ` in the normal modal logic KT (also called T). KT extends system K by adding the instances of the T-axiom schema `□φ ~> φ` to K’s usual axioms and rules of inference.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

@file FormalConjectures/Arxiv/1308.0994/BoxdotConjecture.lean
