@file FormalConjectures/Arxiv/2107.00295/IndependentDomination.lean
@decl Arxiv.«2107.00295».independentDominationOdd
-- L4DEL: title: Conjecture 1.6 (Odd case).** For a nonempty isolate-free graph $G$ on $n$ vertices, if $D$ is odd, then $(D + 1)(D + 3) \cdot i(G) \leq (D^2 + 3) \cdot n$
