-- L4DEL: intuition: TxGraffiti Conjecture 2: for every connected graph $G$ with $\Delta(G) \le 3$ and $G \ne K_4$, $$Z(G) \le \alpha(G) + 1.$$ This conjecture is **false**. Fischer gives a connected 24-vertex counterexample with maximum degree $3$; see arXiv:2607.23664.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

