-- L4DEL: intuition: For a monic polynomial $p(x)=\prod_{i\le n}(x- \lambda_i)$, define $$\Phi_n(p):=\sum_{i\le n}(\sum_{j\neq i} \frac1{\lambda_i-\lambda_j})^2$$ and $\Phi_n(p):=\infty$ if $p$ has a multiple root.
