@file FormalConjectures/Arxiv/math.0608009/PoissonConjecture.lean
@decl Arxiv.«math.0608009».PoissonConjectureFor
-- L4DEL: title: The Poisson Conjecture in dimension `n` ($PC_n$ in the notation of [AvdE07]): every endomorphism of the `n`-th canonical Poisson algebra over `K` is an automorphism
-- L4DEL: intuition: The Poisson Conjecture in dimension `n` ($PC_n$ in the notation of [AvdE07]): every endomorphism of the `n`-th canonical Poisson algebra over `K` is an automorphism. An endomorphism is an automorphism iff it is bijective, since the inverse of a bijective algebra endomorphism preserving the Poisson bracket is again such.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

