-- L4DEL: intuition: The set $C(\alpha)$ of Problem 10.61. For $\alpha > 2$ it is a Cantor set of Hausdorff dimension $\log 2 / \log \alpha < 1$, normalised so that $0$ is its least and $1$ its greatest element.
