-- L4DEL: title: In fact he proved that if $\liminf \frac{\phi_A(k)}{n_k}=0$ then $\limsup \frac{\phi_A(k)}{n_k}=1$
-- L4DEL: intuition: In fact he proved that if $\liminf \frac{\phi_A(k)}{n_k}=0$ then $\limsup \frac{\phi_A(k)}{n_k}=1$.
