-- L4DEL: intuition: Is there a constant $c > 0$ such that every graph on $2^n$ vertices with minimum degree $> (1-c) \cdot 2^n$ contains the $n$-dimensional hypercube $Q_n$? This is Erdős's question [Er93, p. 345]. See also [576] for the extremal number of edges that guarantee a $Q_n$.
