@decl Erdos1041.exists_connected_component_contains_two_roots
-- L4DEL: title: Documented declaration: exists_connected_component_contains_two_roots
-- L4DEL: intuition: **Erdős–Herzog–Piranian Component Lemma** (Metric Properties of Polynomials, 1958): If $f$ is a monic degree $n$ polynomial with all roots in the unit disk, then some connected component of $\{z \mid |f(z)| < 1\}$ contains at least two roots with multiplicity. See p. 139, above Problem 5: [EHP58] Erdős, P. and Herzog, F. and Piranian, G., _Metric properties of polynomials_. J. Analyse Math. (1958), 125-148.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

