-- L4DEL: intuition: The work of de la Bretèche, Ford, and Vandehey [BFV13] implies $$L(m)^{-1+o(1)}< \epsilon_m < L(m)^{-\sqrt{3}/2+o(1)},$$ where $L(m)=\exp(\sqrt{\log m\log\log m})$. The lower bound is implicit in their construction.
