-- L4DEL: title: Characterizes a "snug" finite set of natural numbers: all elements are within a multiplicative factor $(1 + ε)$ of the minimum
-- L4DEL: intuition: Characterizes a "snug" finite set of natural numbers: all elements are within a multiplicative factor $(1 + ε)$ of the minimum. Specifically, for a finite set $A$ and $ε > 0$, all $a ∈ A$ satisfy $a < (1 + ε) · min(A)$.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

