-- L4DEL: intuition: The set of natural numbers that guarantee a monochromatic arithmetic progression. A number `N` belongs to this set if, for a given number of colors `r` and an arithmetic progression length `k`, any `r`-coloring of the integers `{1, ..., N}` must contain a monochromatic arithmetic progression of length `k`.
