-- L4DEL: intuition: Asked by Erdős and Nešetřil, who also ask whether $c(3m+2)=3^m$. Note that the lower bound $1.4457\leq \alpha$ of Gaspers and Mackenzie [GaMa18] provides a negative answer to the above question of Erdős and Nešetřil.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

