-- L4DEL: intuition: Is $2^n$ an example of an irrationality sequence? Kovač and Tao proved that it is not [KoTa24] [KoTa24] Kovač, V. and Tao T., On several irrationality problems for Ahmes series. arXiv:2406.17593 (2024).
