-- L4DEL: intuition: The sum $\sum_n \frac 1 {F_{n}}$ itself was proved to be irrational by André-Jeannin. Ref: André-Jeannin, Richard, _Irrationalité de la somme des inverses de certaines suites récurrentes_.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

