-- L4DEL: intuition: We define a Lucas sequence to be a Fibonacci sequence with arbitrary starting points `L 0` and `L 1`. TODO: There seems to be multiple definitions in the literature, some of which also allow coefficients in the recurrence relation. For now this simple definition has been chosen as it agrees best with the Erdős problem in this same file. However before moving this into `ForMathlib` one should make a conscious decision about which definition to choose.
