-- L4DEL: title: The set of numbers $D(A)$ which occur infinitely often as $a_1 - a_2$ with $a_1, a_2 \in A$
-- L4DEL: intuition: The set of numbers $D(A)$ which occur infinitely often as $a_1 - a_2$ with $a_1, a_2 \in A$.
