-- L4DEL: intuition: Yu and Liu [YuLi96] showed that the only solutions to $(p-1)! + a^(p-1) = p^k$ for an odd prime p are: $$ 2! + 1^2 = 3\\ 2! + 5^2 = 3^3\\ 4! + 1^4 = 5^2 $$
