-- L4DEL: intuition: `NtupleCondition A n` says that the sum of `n` elements of `A` determines the summands, counted with multiplicity and up to permutation. Multisets allow a summand to occur more than once, while multiset equality identifies precisely the trivial coincidences obtained by reordering the summands.
