-- L4DEL: intuition: `IsConsecutiveBlockSum a k m` means that $m$ equals the sum of at least two consecutive terms of the sequence $a$, using indices from $\{1, \ldots, k - 1\}$. That is, there exist $i, j$ with $1 \le i$, $i + 1 \le j$, $j \le k - 1$ such that $m = a(i) + a(i+1) + \cdots + a(j)$.
