@file FormalConjectures/ErdosProblems/463.lean
@decl Erdos463.erdos_463
-- L4DEL: title: Documented declaration: erdos_463
-- L4DEL: intuition: Is there a function $f$ with $f(n)\to\infty$ as $n\to\infty$ such that, for all large $n$, there is a composite number $m$ such that $$ n + f(n) < m < n + p(m) $$ Here $p(m)$ is the least prime factor of $m$.
