@file FormalConjectures/ErdosProblems/480.lean
@decl Erdos480.erdos_480.variants.chung_graham
-- L4DEL: title: Documented declaration: chung_graham
-- L4DEL: intuition: This was proved by Chung and Graham \cite{ChGr84}, who in fact prove that $$\inf_n \liminf_{m\to \infty} n \lvert x_{m+n}-x_m\rvert\leq \frac{1}{c}\approx 0.3944$$ where $$c=1+\sum_{k\geq 1}\frac{1}{F_{2k}}=2.5353705\cdots$$ and $F_m$ is the $m$th Fibonacci number.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

