-- L4DEL: intuition: Tutte and Zykov [Zy52] independently proved that for every $k$ there is a graph with $\omega(G) = 2$ and $\chi(G) = k$. We require $k \geq 2$: a graph with $\omega(G) = 2$ has an edge, so $\chi(G) \geq 2$.
