-- L4DEL: intuition: If ℕ is $2$-coloured then there must exist a monochromatic three-term arithmetic progression $x,x+d,x+2d$ such that $d>x$. This was first proved by Brown and Landman [BrLa99], who in fact show that this is always possible with $d>f(x)$ for any increasing function $f$. This was formalized in Lean by Alexeev using Aristotle and ChatGPT.
