-- L4DEL: intuition: Characterise those composite $n$ such that $f(n) = n/Q(n)$, where $Q(n)$ is the largest prime-power divisor of $n$. This is the reading of part (a) in Erdős–Szekeres ErSz78, pp. 98–99.
