-- L4DEL: intuition: **Erdős Problem 707**: It is false that any finite Sidon set can be embedded in a perfect different set modulo some $n$. As described in [arxiv/2510.19804], a counterexample is provided in [Ha47], see below. The proof of this has been formalized. This was formalized in Lean by Alexeev using ChatGPT.
