-- L4DEL: intuition: This conjecture was actually first disproved by Hall in 1947 [Ha47], long before Erdős asked this question. A counterexample for any modulus from from [Ha47] in the paragraph following Theorem 4.3, where it was given as $\{-8, -6, 0, 1, 4\}$, but this can be shifted to natural numbers as pointed out in [arxiv/2510.19804].
