-- L4DEL: intuition: Alon [Al92] proved that, for every $n$, there exists a graph $G$ on $n$ vertices such that $$\chi_L(G)+\chi_L(G^c)\ll (n\log n)^{1/2},$$ where the implied constant is absolute.
