-- L4DEL: title: Documented declaration: harrisHypergraph
-- L4DEL: intuition: The `3`-uniform hypergraph on `Fin 9` given by Harris: the `27` triples containing exactly one vertex from each of the three parts `{0, 1, 2}`, `{3, 4, 5}`, `{6, 7, 8}`, together with the triple `{0, 1, 2}`. A triple is a transversal of the three parts exactly when the three values of `v ↦ v / 3` it produces are distinct.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

