-- L4DEL: intuition: Bucić and Sudakov [BuSu23] proved that $h(n) \gg n^{5/12-o(1)}$. Their result is stated for graphs in which every $7$ vertices contain an independent set of size $3$; it applies to $h$ by taking complements.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

