-- L4DEL: intuition: The lower half of `Erdos813.erdos_813` has a positive answer: there is a constant $c_1 > 0$ with $n^{1/3+c_1} \ll h(n)$. This follows from the bound $h(n) \gg n^{5/12-o(1)}$ of Bucić and Sudakov [BuSu23], since $5/12 > 1/3$.
