@decl Erdos865.erdos_865.variants.sos
-- L4DEL: title: Documented declaration: sos
-- L4DEL: intuition: Erdős and Sós conjectured that $f_k(N)\sim \frac{1}{2}\left(1+\sum_{1\leq r\leq k-2}\frac{1}{4^r}\right) N$, where $f_k(N)$ is the minimal size of a subset of $\{1, \dots, N\}$ guaranteeing $k$ elements have all pairwise sums in the set.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

