@file FormalConjectures/ErdosProblems/872.lean
@decl Erdos872.gameValueAux
-- L4DEL: title: Auxiliary finite minimax recursion with an explicit fuel bound
-- L4DEL: intuition: Auxiliary finite minimax recursion with an explicit fuel bound. At a Prolonger turn (`turn = true`) the recursion takes the maximum over legal moves; at a Shortener turn (`turn = false`) it takes the minimum. If there are no legal moves, or the fuel is exhausted, it returns the current final size `p.claimed.card`. Starting with fuel `p.pool.card` is sufficient because every played move erases the chosen pool element.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

