@file FormalConjectures/ErdosProblems/98.lean
@decl Erdos98.erdos_98.variants.upper_bound
-- L4DEL: title: Erdős could not even prove $h(n)\geq n$
-- L4DEL: intuition: Erdős could not even prove $h(n)\geq n$. Pach has shown $h(n) < n^{\log_2 3}$. Erdős, Füredi, and Pach [EFPR93] have improved this to $h(n) < n\exp(c\sqrt{\log n})$ for some constant $c>0$.
