-- L4DEL: intuition: An order automorphism $f$ of $\mathbb{R}$ is *locally right $H$-linear* if every point has a right neighbourhood on which $f$ is affine with slope in $H \le \mathbb{R}_{>0}$.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

