-- L4DEL: intuition: The growth condition on $\omega$: the ratio $\omega(p) / p$ tends to infinity as the prime $p$ tends to infinity, i.e. $\lim_{p \to \infty} \omega(p) / p = \infty$. Here the source filter is `Filter.atTop` on the primes, obtained by pulling back `Filter.atTop` on $\mathbb{N}$ along the coercion `Nat.Primes → ℕ`.
