-- L4DEL: intuition: Auxiliary decision procedure for `Reachable`, taking a fuel argument `f` bounding `m`. `reachable_iff_of_two_le` reduces `Reachable m n` for `2 ≤ m` to statements `Reachable m' n'` with `m' < m`, so one unit of fuel per unit of `m` always suffices. Recursing on the fuel rather than on `m` makes this structural, so `Reachable.decide` below avoids well-founded recursion.
