-- L4DEL: intuition: A solution to the Navier-Stokes equations on all of $\mathbb{R}^n$ with appropriate decay and energy bounds. In addition to the basic solution properties, we require: - The velocity is in $L^2$ at each time $t \ge 0$ (finite kinetic energy) - The total energy remains bounded for all time (condition 7)
