@decl ComplexityTheory.P_subset_BPP
-- L4DEL: title: The theorem that P is a subset of BPP
-- L4DEL: intuition: The theorem that P is a subset of BPP. This can be proven by observing that for any language in P, we can construct a randomized decider that ignores the random bits and simply runs the poly-time decider for the language.
