-- L4DEL: intuition: The **Generalized Riemann Hypothesis** asserts that all the non-trivial zeros of the Dirichlet $L$-function $L(\chi, s)$ of a primitive Dirichlet character $\chi$ have real part $\frac{1}{2}$.
