@decl OeisA100475.aStartAt_zero
-- L4DEL: title: The totalized recurrence stays at zero when initialized at zero
-- L4DEL: intuition: The totalized recurrence stays at zero when initialized at zero. The OEIS recurrence itself uses one-based prime indices, so this is a boundary behavior of the formalization rather than a term of the original sequence.
