-- L4DEL: intuition: Starting with other values of $a(1)$, $a(2)$, $a(3)$, $a(4)$, $a(5)$ what behaviors are possible? Does the sequence always stick at a single integer after some point, or can it go into a loop, or is there a third pattern? KitaKen1 showed the sequence either becomes constant or goes into a loop, see https://github.com/KitaKen1/oeis-a100478-eventual-periodicity/blob/642eed0ffee26415528ab8c48c5181826be04860/lean/OeisA100478FC.lean#L158-L168. tadamcz showed the sequence always becomes constant, see https://tadamcz.com/fc-review-results/aea251bb26/#/f/OEIS/100478.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

