-- L4DEL: intuition: Conjecture 2: 1, 6 and 16 appear only once and 3 appears twice in the sequence, i.e., $a(1) = 1$, $a(2) = 6$, $a(4) = a(5) = 3$, and $a(8) = 16$. - _Ya-Ping Lu_, May 04 2024
