@file FormalConjectures/OEIS/267581.lean
@decl OeisA267581.oeisFloorTerm
-- L4DEL: title: The floor term in the conjectured recurrence relation for A267581
-- L4DEL: intuition: The floor term in the conjectured recurrence relation for A267581. This term, $\lfloor (1/2)^{(2^{n+1} \bmod n)} \rfloor$, simplifies to 1 if $(2^{n+1} \bmod n) = 0$ (i.e., $n \mid 2^{n+1}$), and 0 otherwise. Since the recurrence is only stated for $n \ge 2$, the $n=0$ case is irrelevant to the conjecture.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

