@file FormalConjectures/OEIS/282779.lean
@decl OeisA282779.a
-- L4DEL: title: Period of cubes mod $n$
-- L4DEL: intuition: Period of cubes mod $n$. The $n$-th term $a(n)$ is the smallest positive integer $T$ such that $\forall k \in \mathbb{N}$, $(k+T)^3 \equiv k^3 \pmod n$.
