@file FormalConjectures/OEIS/78729.lean
@decl OeisA78729.conjecture
-- L4DEL: title: $(k+1)(k+2)(k+3)(k+4) + 1 = (k^2 + 5k + 5)^2$, which is never prime
-- L4DEL: intuition: $(k+1)(k+2)(k+3)(k+4) + 1 = (k^2 + 5k + 5)^2$, which is never prime. Hence $a(4) = 0$. Conjecture: $a(n) = 0$ if and only if $n = 4$.
