-- L4DEL: intuition: Sanity check: the first center-column values reproduce the known Rule 30 center column (OEIS A051023). Unlike `state_zero`/`state_succ`, this exercises the composed evolution, guarding against a wrong seed, a swapped `xor`/`||`, or an off-by-one neighbour index.
