-- L4DEL: intuition: **Macaulay's theorem**: every homogeneous ideal has the same Hilbert function as a lex ideal. This is the case $c = 0$ of `eisenbud_green_harris`, where the ideal of pure powers is zero (`MvPolynomial.purePowersIdeal_zero`).
