-- L4DEL: title: Every sum of squares in $\mathbb{R}$ is a square and $1$ is not a sum of zero squares, so $p(\mathbb{R}) = 1$
-- L4DEL: intuition: Every sum of squares in $\mathbb{R}$ is a square and $1$ is not a sum of zero squares, so $p(\mathbb{R}) = 1$.
