@file FormalConjectures/Paper/RiemannHypothesisEquivalents.lean
@decl RiemannHypothesis.robin_criterion
-- L4DEL: title: Robin's Criterion**
-- L4DEL: intuition: **Robin's Criterion**. The Riemann Hypothesis is equivalent to $$ \sigma(n) < e ^ {\gamma} n\log\log n $$ for all $n > 5040$, where $\gamma$ is the Euler-Mascheroni constant and $\sigma(n)$ is the sum of divisors.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

