@decl SerreUniformity.serre_uniformity
-- L4DEL: title: Documented declaration: serre_uniformity
-- L4DEL: intuition: **Serre's uniformity question over $\mathbb{Q}$** [Ser72, Lem17]: is there a bound $C$ such that every non-CM elliptic curve over $\mathbb{Q}$ has surjective mod-$p$ Galois representation for every prime $p > C$?
