@decl ZagierMZV.zagier_conjecture
-- L4DEL: title: Documented declaration: zagier_conjecture
-- L4DEL: intuition: **Zagier's conjecture** The $\mathbb{Q}$-dimension of the vector space spanned by all multiple zeta values of weight $n$ equals $d_n$, where $d_n$ is the Zagier dimension sequence satisfying $d_0 = 1$, $d_1 = 0$, $d_2 = 1$, and $d_n = d_{n-2} + d_{n-3}$ for $n \geq 3$.
