@decl BeckFiala.beck_fiala_conjecture
-- L4DEL: title: Documented declaration: beck_fiala_conjecture
-- L4DEL: intuition: **The Beck–Fiala conjecture** There exists a universal constant $C > 0$ such that every set system $S_1, \dots, S_m \subseteq [n]$ of degree at most $t$ admits a colouring $\chi \colon [n] \to \{-1, +1\}$ with $\left|\sum_{j \in S_i} \chi(j)\right| \le C \sqrt{t}$ for every $i$.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

@file FormalConjectures/Wikipedia/BeckFialaConjecture.lean
