@decl LehmerMahlerMeasureProblem.lehmer_mahler_measure_problem.variants.not_reciprocal
-- L4DEL: title: If $f$ is irreducible and not reciprocal and $M(f) > 1$ then $M(f) \ge M(X^3 - X - 1)$
-- L4DEL: intuition: If $f$ is irreducible and not reciprocal and $M(f) > 1$ then $M(f) \ge M(X^3 - X - 1)$.
