-- L4DEL: intuition: For an $n$-tuple of distinct integer velocities $v_1,\dots,v_n$, `deltaTuple v` is the maximal value of $\min_i \|t v_i\|_{\mathbb{R}/\mathbb{Z}}$ over time.
