-- L4DEL: intuition: **The explicit bound of Esperet–Kardoš–King–Král'–Norine (2011).** Every bridgeless cubic graph on $n$ vertices has at least $2^{n/3656}$ perfect matchings. *Reference:* [EKKKN11].
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

