@decl RudinsConjecture.Q_six_twentyfour_one
-- L4DEL: title: Documented declaration: Q_six_twentyfour_one
-- L4DEL: intuition: Sanity check pinning `Q` to a concrete value: among the first `6` terms of `24 n + 1`, namely `1, 25, 49, 73, 97, 121`, exactly four are perfect squares (`1, 25, 49, 121`), so `Q 6 24 1 = 4`. This validates the definition of `Q` and matches the claim that `24 n + 1` is the extremal progression.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

