@decl SerreMultiplicityConjectures.intersectionMultiplicity_pos_of_unramified
-- L4DEL: title: Documented declaration: intersectionMultiplicity_pos_of_unramified
-- L4DEL: intuition: Serre proved the positivity conjecture when $R$ is of mixed characteristic and unramified, that is, when the characteristic $p$ of the residue field is not in the square of the maximal ideal of $R$ [Se00]. The hypothesis $p \notin \mathfrak m^2$ excludes $p = 0$ and the equal characteristic case, where $p = 0$ in $R$.
