@file FormalConjectures/Wikipedia/SerreMultiplicityConjectures.lean
@decl SerreMultiplicityConjectures.intersectionMultiplicity_pos_quotient
-- L4DEL: title: Positivity conjecture**, in the form stated on Wikipedia
-- L4DEL: intuition: **Positivity conjecture**, in the form stated on Wikipedia. Let $R$ be a regular local ring and let $P$, $Q$ be prime ideals of $R$ such that $R/P \otimes_R R/Q$ has finite length. If $\dim R/P + \dim R/Q = \dim R$, then $\chi(R/P, R/Q) > 0$.
