@file FormalConjectures/Wikipedia/SurjunctiveGroup.lean
@decl GottschalkSurjunctivity.gottschalk_surjunctivity_conjecture
-- L4DEL: title: Gottschalk's surjunctivity conjecture** (1973): every group is surjunctive
-- L4DEL: intuition: **Gottschalk's surjunctivity conjecture** (1973): every group is surjunctive. That is, for every group `G` and every finite alphabet `A`, every injective cellular automaton on `A^G` is surjective.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

@file FormalConjectures/Wikipedia/SurjunctiveGroup.lean
@decl GottschalkSurjunctivity.IsShiftEquivariant
-- L4DEL: title: A map `τ : (G → A) → (G → A)` is *equivariant* (with respect to the left shift action) if `τ(shift g x) = shift g (τ x)` for all `g : G` and `x : G → A`
-- L4DEL: intuition: A map `τ : (G → A) → (G → A)` is *equivariant* (with respect to the left shift action) if `τ(shift g x) = shift g (τ x)` for all `g : G` and `x : G → A`.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

@file FormalConjectures/Wikipedia/SurjunctiveGroup.lean
@decl GottschalkSurjunctivity.IsSurjunctive
-- L4DEL: title: A group `G` is *surjunctive* if for every finite nonempty type `A`, every injective, continuous, shift-equivariant map `(G → A) → (G → A)` is also surjective
-- L4DEL: intuition: A group `G` is *surjunctive* if for every finite nonempty type `A`, every injective, continuous, shift-equivariant map `(G → A) → (G → A)` is also surjective. Continuity is with respect to the product topology on `G → A` where `A` carries the discrete topology.
-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

@file FormalConjectures/Wikipedia/SurjunctiveGroup.lean
@decl GottschalkSurjunctivity.isSurjunctive_of_finite
