-- L4DEL: step: This explanation is a condensed rendering of the declaration's own doc comment at the pinned source commit; consult the exact Lean statement below for authority.

@file FormalConjecturesForMathlib/Combinatorics/SimpleGraph/AnnihilationNumber.lean
@decl SimpleGraph.annihilationNumber'
-- L4DEL: title: Computes the annihilation number of a graph G
-- L4DEL: intuition: Computes the annihilation number of a graph G. It calculates the degree sequence, sorts it ascendingly, and finds the largest prefix length 'k' (where `0 ≤ k ≤ |V(G)|`) such that the sum of the prefix is less than or equal to the sum of the corresponding suffix.
