-- L4DEL: intuition: The *saturation number* `μ*(G)` (also called the lower matching number): the minimum number of edges in a maximal matching of `G`. Every finite graph has a maximal matching (extend the empty matching greedily), so this set is nonempty and the infimum is a genuine minimum.
