-- L4DEL: intuition: `G` is a **unique subgraph** of `H` if there is exactly one subgraph of `H` isomorphic to `G`. Subgraphs of `H` are taken in the spanning sense: elements `G' ≤ H` of the lattice `SimpleGraph V`, i.e. subsets of the edges of `H` (not necessarily induced).
