-- L4DEL: intuition: The number of distinct unique subgraphs of `H`: the number of isomorphism classes of graphs that occur exactly once as a subgraph of `H`. Each such class contains exactly one subgraph `G ≤ H` (uniqueness forbids a second isomorphic copy), so counting those representatives counts the classes.
